            "sid": "REV 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku yaabambwire akamanyiso ka kataano, naareeba ahansi y'eitambiro emyoyo y'abaitsirwe ahabw'ekigambo kya Ruhanga n'ahabw'obujurizi obu baahaire; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.32.43"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bir 32:43",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " baataka n'eiraka rihango, nibagira bati: Ai bambe, Mukama waitu orikwera kandi ow'amazima, oryahitsya hi okutacwera rubanja abatuura omu nsi n'okubahoora enzigu ahabw'eshagama yaitu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.23.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 23:32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima buri omwe yaaheebwa ekijwaro ekirikwera, kandi baaragiirwa kumara ogundi mwanya mukye bahuumwire, okuhitsya omuhendo gw'abaheereza bagyenzi baabo na beene waabo, abarikwija kwitwa nkabo, obu gurihika.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
